    <p class="wg-section-label wg-workshop-label">Launch workshop</p>
    <h3 class="wg-workshop-subtitle">The 2024 Ljubljana meeting</h3>
    <p>Hosted at the National Institute of Biology in Ljubljana, the April 2024 meeting brought together specialists in ecology, molecular biology, remote sensing, data infrastructure and artificial intelligence.</p>
    <p>Twelve talks covered practical systems already being used or developed—from autonomous insect collection and nanopore sequencing to camera traps, acoustic monitoring, habitat mapping and FAIR digital-twin infrastructure. A closing panel identified common obstacles and opportunities for cooperation.</p>
